Package: rcef
Type: Package
Title: Discard Raising and Length/Age Allocation over CEF (RDBES) Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Damian", "Villagra",
                  email = "damian.villagra@ilvo.vlaanderen.be",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Damian Villagra [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Damian Villagra <damian.villagra@ilvo.vlaanderen.be>
Description: Implements the ICES discard-raising and length/age catch
    allocation workflows over CEF (RDBES) long-format data. Provides
    stratum construction and sampling-status classification, automatic
    (hierarchical cascade) and manual raising-group definition, wrappers
    around the ICES catchRaising() and catchAllocationAoL() routines, a
    consistent plotting layer, and emitters that write the analysis out as
    a reproducible script set in ICES TAF layout. The Shiny workbench that
    drives these functions ships with the package and is started with
    run_app(); every function here is usable from a plain R session
    without it.
